    "body": "@lukewarlow I think that ef870efcca2cf3a37336e41ff22a5ba143860ce8 changed things in a way that ought to be observable. Instead of resetting the form owner of all elements that had *removedNode* as their form owner, now only the subset of those elements that remains in the tree gets their form owner reset.\r\n\r\nIf those elements are then reinserted, it ought to be possible to tell the difference? If this is also follow-up being handled elsewhere, then yes this can be merged (and I can do it if nobody beats me to it). But if that wasn't intended, is a further change needed?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/7143366655/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
